# .pubignore replaces .gitignore for `dart pub publish`, so it has to repeat
# the build outputs .gitignore already excludes, or they end up in the archive.
*.lock
build/
.dart_tool/
coverage/
.idea/
.DS_Store
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/**/xcuserdata/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties

# Repository-only documents, not package documentation.
CLAUDE.md
docs/
